":"芸能界という世界を何一つ知らない私でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不安でいっぱいだったんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい場所で１からスタートすることが怖かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たり前だが、みんなのことも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初対面だし全く知らない子達。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとこのオーディションを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受けなければ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと乃木坂46では無かったら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出逢うことは無かったね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄い確率。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全く知らない人や場所"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしたらいいかわからない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何から始めればいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何をしよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不安ばかりを抱えていた結成。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの結成の日から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日レッスンがあって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日研修をして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日支えあって、笑い合ったね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わからないところは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"互いに教えあい、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいことがあったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"共有し、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悲しいことがあったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"互いに励まし合ったね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何も出来なくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何もわからなかった私は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のことを学んだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のことを知りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々出来るようになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はあの頃とは違う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すべて、みんなのおかげ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全く知らなくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自己紹介から初めた私達は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ではお互い信頼し、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番の支えになって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かけがえの無い存在になっているね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しいこともあったね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悲しいことだって沢山あった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲間だから争いたくないのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"競争しなきゃいけなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛かったよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、乃木坂46の仲間といる時は一番楽しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番笑った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは今も変わらず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとこれからも変わらず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなといる時間が大好きだから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとずっとよろしくね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デビューして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周りの方への"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝の気持ちも改めて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感じました。"},{"type":"b